// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1020227902" "It's time to put my plan into action! I will lay low my psychic rival, the famous Aurora Borealis! She's meddled in my plans for far too long! Aurora Borealis is currently in a Paragon City hospital helping victims of Rikti experimentation. Her pathetic sympathy shall be her downfall! I will give to you the Psionic Activator you stole from the Aeon lab - use it on the Rikti experimentation victims and you'll gain allies for your fight against Aurora Borealis and her Longbow compatriots!<br><br>Know that the fight against Aurora Borealis will not be an easy one. <color orange>You might require aid from other villains in order to defeat her.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P1256500433" "Defeat Aurora Borealis and allies"
// SendOffString :
"P678857923" "When you have defeated her, I will feed upon her psychic energies through the psi-crystals!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P978915425" "I have given you the tools to defeat Aurora Borealis. Make haste!"

